'''Buzzwole ex''' (Japanese: '''マッシブーンex''' ''Massivoon ex'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

