==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's immersive illustration features all of the [[Ultra Beast]]s—{{p|Buzzwole}}, {{p|Nihilego}}, {{p|Pheromosa}}, {{p|Xurkitree}}, {{P|Celesteela}}, {{p|Kartana}}, {{P|Guzzlord}}, {{p|Poipole}}, {{p|Naganadel}}, {{p|Stakataka}}, and {{p|Blacephalon}}—appearing from an [[Ultra Wormhole]].
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Buzzwole}}.
*'''Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Genesis|Electabuzz|33}} from the {{TCG|Neo Genesis}} expansion.
*The '''Big Beat''' attack is named after {{wp|big beat}}, a genre of music. The name may have been chosen in reference to {{p|Buzzwole}}'s size and physical strength.

